&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:63.8pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27.8pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（注）2024年５月24日取締役会決議による１株当たり配当額には、創業100周年記念配当２円が含まれておりす。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:63.8pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27.8pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:13pt;font-size:13pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingDividendTextBlock>
